        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSB66BB, 6\" x 6\" x Square Corners with 4 Ball Bearings Solid Brass Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackage includes a pair of hinges (2), matching solid brass flathead, Phillips Drive #14 x 1-1/2\" wood screws and standard removable button tip finials.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFitted with a high grade, removable, rust resistant, stainless steel pin. Utilizes template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"300\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSB66BB.jpg?v=1704354517\" width=\"300\" height=\"335\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSB66BB Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 6 Inch Brass Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Quad Ball-Bearing: 4BB</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.205\"</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #14 x 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSB66BB.pdf?v=1704262166\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSB66BB Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\">finishes</a> for this hinge, but no matter which finish you choose, the parts will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTo spice up your 6\" x 6\" brass hinges add <a href=\"/products/large-ball-tip-solid-brass-finial-deltana-dsbtl\">Large Ball Tip Finials</a>!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "6 x 6 x Square Corners Heavy Duty with Ball Bearing Solid Brass Hinge, Pair, DSB66BB",
                "description": "Deltana DSB66BB 6 x 6 Solid Brass Hinge, with 4 Ball Bearings DSB66BB. Heavy Duty 0.205 thick. Package includes a pair of hinges, matching solid brass flathead, Phillips screws and standard removable button tip finials. ",
